invariant in_s1(X) <-> exists Y. s1(X,Y)
invariant in_s2(X) <-> exists Y. s2(X,Y)
invariant s1(X,Y) -> a(X) & a(Y)
invariant s2(X,Y) -> a(X) & a(Y)
invariant p(X,Y) -> a(X) & a(Y)
invariant reach(org)
invariant reach(X) -> a(X)
invariant (s1(X,Y) & a(Y) & reach(Y)) -> reach(X)
invariant (s1(X,Y) & ~a(Y) & s2(X,Z) & a(Z) & reach(Z)) -> reach(X)
invariant (ring.btw(X,Y,org) & a(Y)) -> reach(Y)

